<title>POLAND: Budimex signs $18.5 mln Russian contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex signs $18.5 mln Russian contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Budimex SA signed an $18.5-million contract with Russian firm Rostek-Moscow to build a Polish-Russian border crossing in Russia's Kaliningrad enclave, Budimex said in a statement.</p>
<p>Budimex said in a Thursday statement the works would be carried out in 10 months.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
